concept:australian-federal-police-legislation-amendment-act-2000-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Schedule(s)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "Subject to section 2, each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.  Amendment of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979  Schedule 1" ;
