    values:originalText "(7) In this section: common services includes services consisting of, or provided by means of:  (a) computer systems; or  (b) forensic science laboratories; or  (c) research and planning systems; or  (d) training institutions; or  (e) anything of a like nature. Secretary means the Secretary to the Department." ;
    cof:pageNumber "26"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-federal-police-legislation-amendment-act-2000-sch-1-sec-38-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "38 Commissioner’s Orders"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-38-2 ;
    values:originalText "In the exercise of his or her powers under section 37, the Commissioner may, by writing, issue orders with respect to the  Schedule 1  Amendment of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979  general administration of, and the control of the operations of, the Australian Federal Police." ;
    skos:definition "In the exercise of his or her powers under section 37, the Commissioner may, by writing, issue orders with respect to the  Schedule 1  Amendment of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979  general administration of, and the control of the operations of, the Australian Federal Police."@en ;
