concept:australian-federal-police-legislation-amendment-act-2000-sch-1-sec-39-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "39 Compliance with Commissioner’s Orders"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-39-2 ;
    values:originalText "An AFP employee or a special member must comply with Commissioner’s Orders. Note: The regulations may make provision for the consequences of contravening this section: see paragraph 70(i)." ;
