    values:originalText "An AFP employee or a special member must not:  (a) disobey; or  (b) fail to carry out; a lawful direction, instruction or order, whether written or oral, given to him or her by:  (c) the Commissioner; or  (d) a Deputy Commissioner; or  (e) the AFP employee or the special member under whose control, direction or supervision he or she performs his or her duties. Note: The regulations may make provision for the consequences of contravening this section: see paragraph 70(i)." ;
