concept:australian-federal-police-legislation-amendment-act-2000-sch-1-sec-40h-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40H(2) Assignment of duties etc."@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-40h-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Commissioner may from time to time determine in writing the terms and conditions applying to an AFP employee while the employee is performing duties outside Australia. Duties to meet special operational needs" ;
