doc:sch-1-sec-40h-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "40H(2) Assignment of duties etc." ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Commissioner may from time to time determine in writing the terms and conditions applying to an AFP employee while the employee is performing duties outside Australia. Duties to meet special operational needs" ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-federal-police-legislation-amendment-act-2000-sch-1-sec-40h-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40H(3) Assignment of duties etc."@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-40h-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If:  (a) the Commissioner makes a determination under subsection (1); and  Amendment of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979  Schedule 1  (b) the Commissioner specifies in the determination that the duties concerned are to meet the special operational needs of the Australian Federal Police; the Commissioner may determine in writing the accommodation arrangements that are to apply to the employee, or any allowances the employee is to be paid, while the employee is performing those duties." ;
    skos:definition "(3) If:  (a) the Commissioner makes a determination under subsection (1); and  Amendment of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979  Schedule 1  (b) the Commissioner specifies in the determination that the duties concerned are to meet the special operational needs of the Australian Federal Police; the Commissioner may determine in writing the accommodation arrangements that are to apply to the employee, or any allowances the employee is to be paid, while the employee is performing those duties."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bd4ecbc7e0e4834b4d2b8e6049416681e30fb973ce2bdc618f4c2f7f77101179" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-federal-police-legislation-amendment-act-2000-sch-1-sec-40h ;
