concept:australian-federal-police-legislation-amendment-act-2000-sch-1-sec-57 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "57 Paragraph 47(3)(a)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-57 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (a) who:  Amendment of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979  Schedule 1  (i) was an AFP employee at the time the relevant corruption offence was committed but was not such an employee when charged with that offence; or  (ii) was an old law member or staff member at the time the relevant corruption offence was committed but was not such a member or an AFP employee when charged with that offence; and" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (a) who:  Amendment of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979  Schedule 1  (i) was an AFP employee at the time the relevant corruption offence was committed but was not such an employee when charged with that offence; or  (ii) was an old law member or staff member at the time the relevant corruption offence was committed but was not such a member or an AFP employee when charged with that offence; and"@en ;
