 relevant event mentioned in paragraph (3)(a) or (b) happened. Interpretation  (5) To avoid doubt, for the purposes of paragraph (1)(b), a person does not cease to be an AFP employee in circumstances where the person completes a period of engagement under section 24 (the initial period) and is re-engaged under that section for a further period starting immediately after the end of the initial period." ;
