concept:australian-federal-police-legislation-amendment-act-2000-sch-1-sec-69c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "69C Delegation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-69c ;
    values:originalText "The Commissioner may, in writing, delegate to a Deputy Commissioner, an AFP employee or a special member, all or any of the Commissioner’s powers, functions or duties under this Act.  Amendment of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979  Schedule 1" ;
    skos:definition "The Commissioner may, in writing, delegate to a Deputy Commissioner, an AFP employee or a special member, all or any of the Commissioner’s powers, functions or duties under this Act.  Amendment of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979  Schedule 1"@en ;
