    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-11 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (7) For the purposes of subsection (1), an authorised member is an AFP appointee (other than the appointee against whom the complaint is made) who is a member of the Australian Federal Police and who is authorised in writing by the Commissioner for the purposes of this section." ;
