concept:australian-federal-police-legislation-amendment-act-2000-sch-2-sec-57 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "57 Section 10"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-57 ;
    values:originalText "Schedule 2  Amendment of other Acts  Omit “a member, or staff member, of the Australian Federal Police (other than the Commissioner of Police or a Deputy Commissioner of Police)”, substitute “an AFP employee (within the meaning of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979)”. Note: The heading to section 10 is replaced by the heading “Australian Federal Police employees”. Telecommunications (Interception) Act 1979" ;
