concept:australian-federal-police-legislation-amendment-act-2000-sch-3-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 Determinations under subsection 30(1) of the former Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "(1) At the commencing time, the Commissioner is taken to make a determination (a continued determination) under subsection 27(1) of the later Act containing the terms of each determination under  Application and transitional provisions  Schedule 3 Application and transitional provisions relating to the amendments made by Schedule 1" ;
