concept:australian-federal-police-legislation-amendment-act-2000-sch-3-sec-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 Certificates under subsection 12A(4) of the Australian"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-10 ;
    values:originalText "Federal Police Act 1979 Subsection 12A(4) of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979 as in force at and after the commencing time applies to a certificate given under that subsection at any time before the commencing time in the same way as it does to a certificate given under that subsection at or after the commencing time." ;
    skos:definition "Federal Police Act 1979 Subsection 12A(4) of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979 as in force at and after the commencing time applies to a certificate given under that subsection at any time before the commencing time in the same way as it does to a certificate given under that subsection at or after the commencing time."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6b9d11850dd707b8062c7ef0f85dc0e117947a8df051d2af140d0a58efdd431b" ;
