concept:australian-federal-police-legislation-amendment-act-2000-sch-3-sec-15 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15 Continuation of section 52 of the Australian Federal Police"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15 ;
    values:originalText "Act 1979 The amendment of section 52 of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979 made by Schedule 1 to this Act applies to proceedings started against a person whether before or after the commencing time, but does not apply where persons’ resignations or retirements from the Australian Federal Police would, but for subsection (1) of that section as in force immediately before the commencing time, have taken effect before the commencing time." ;
    skos:definition "Act 1979 The amendment of section 52 of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979 made by Schedule 1 to this Act applies to proceedings started against a person whether before or after the commencing time, but does not apply where persons’ resignations or retirements from the Australian Federal Police would, but for subsection (1) of that section as in force immediately before the commencing time, have taken effect before the commencing time."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e62d2cddad3b874221629f852e964ba350d5d46cb5b8e3c4dfe1e0a71110e4e5" ;
