concept:australian-federal-police-legislation-amendment-act-2000-sch-3-sec-22 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22 Amendments of the Complaints (Australian Federal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-22 ;
    values:originalText "Police) Act 1981 The amendments of the Complaints (Australian Federal Police) Act 1981 made by Schedule 2 to this Act apply to action taken by an AFP appointee (within the meaning of the Complaints (Australian Federal Police) Act 1981 as in force at and after the commencing time) at or after the commencing time." ;
