concept:australian-federal-police-legislation-amendment-act-2000-sch-3-sec-26 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26 Amendment of the Long Service Leave (Commonwealth"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-26 ;
    values:originalText "Employees) Act 1976 The amendment of section 10 of the Long Service Leave (Commonwealth Employees) Act 1976 made by Schedule 2 to this Act does not affect the operation of that Act at, or at any time after, the commencing time in relation to the deeming of a member or staff member of the Australian Federal Police, at any time before the commencing time, to be employed in Government Service for the purposes of that Act." ;
    skos:definition "Employees) Act 1976 The amendment of section 10 of the Long Service Leave (Commonwealth Employees) Act 1976 made by Schedule 2 to this Act does not affect the operation of that Act at, or at any time after, the commencing time in relation to the deeming of a member or staff member of the Australian Federal Police, at any time before the commencing time, to be employed in Government Service for the purposes of that Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fadda44754839e085de7aca3b13646f0639f367a9878bd0b9a7c8bd4a1a913e2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "78"^^xsd:integer ;
