concept:australian-federal-police-legislation-amendment-act-2000-sch-3-sec-28 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "28 Amendment of the Occupational Health and Safety"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-28 ;
    values:originalText "(Commonwealth Employment) Act 1991 The amendment of the Occupational Health and Safety (Commonwealth Employment) Act 1991 made by Schedule 2 to this Act applies to things done at or after the commencing time by or in relation to the Commissioner of the Australian Federal Police, a Deputy Commissioner of the Australian Federal Police or an AFP employee (all within the meaning of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979 as in force at and after the commencing time)." ;
    skos:definition "(Commonwealth Employment) Act 1991 The amendment of the Occupational Health and Safety (Commonwealth Employment) Act 1991 made by Schedule 2 to this Act applies to things done at or after the commencing time by or in relation to the Commissioner of the Australian Federal Police, a Deputy Commissioner of the Australian Federal Police or an AFP employee (all within the meaning of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979 as in force at and after the commencing time)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ba05ef3ae156200e5f77d6a881eb2d83de0a7c3d4b95c93cdb6c145153d663a2" ;
